OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain and thunderstorms
OL,6,Fwill move north through the day, with
OL,7,Fa risk of localised flooding and even
OL,8,Fhail in places. Drier, brighter
OL,9,Fconditions will spread into the south
OL,10,Flater with more isolated showers.
OL,11,FStaying warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers will ease,
OL,14,Fturning drier overnight with some
OL,15,Fpatchy cloud and clear spells. Staying
OL,16,Fmild with light winds for all.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FA dry start to the day, but
OL,19,Fshowers start to develop through the
OL,20,Fafternoon. Again, the risk of thunder
OL,21,Fand possible hail. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
